  <name>Veronica</name>
  <summary>Native control center for Ubuntu</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Veronica replaces a shelf of single-purpose utilities with one native
      application. It tracks coding-agent usage, monitors this machine and your
      SSH hosts, controls media and audio, and adds a hover island to the top
      bar.
    </p>
    <p>Usage data never leaves the machine. There is no account and no telemetry.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.namannn04.Veronica.desktop</launchable>
